# Claude skills conformance

Skills follow the [Agent Skills](https://agentskills.io/) open standard (Claude Code, Cursor, etc.).

## Required frontmatter

| Field | Rule |
|-------|------|
| **name** | Required. Max 64 chars; lowercase letters, numbers, hyphens only (e.g. `md-document`). |
| **description** | Required. Max **1024 characters**. Used for discovery; keep concise and put detail in the body. |

## Structure

- Skill = folder with `SKILL.md` (required) and optional supporting files: `scripts/`, `examples/`, `references/`, etc.
- YAML frontmatter between `---` at top of `SKILL.md`; markdown body for instructions.

## Optional frontmatter (spec)

- `license`, `compatibility`, `metadata`, `allowed-tools` — all optional.
